{"id":"phoenix-staff","name":{"en":"Phoenix Staff","ja":"不死鳥の杖","tc":"不死鳥之杖","sc":"不死鸟之杖"},"desc1":{"en":"A staff made in the shape of a phoenix. The person holding this will be resurrected.","ja":"「不死鳥を象った杖ね。これを持ってる人は、　命を失っても再び蘇るんだとか」","tc":"「這是象徵不死鳥的杖，據說只要拿著這把杖，　即使失去性命也能再次復活。」","sc":"“这是象征不死鸟的杖，据说只要拿着这把杖，　即使失去性命也能再次复活。”"},"desc2":{"en":"That means if you're holding it, you're safe. Don't really want to die to begin with.","ja":"「へぇ…。とりあえず持ってれば安心だけど…　そもそも、命を失いたくはないなぁ…」","tc":"「哦……那總之拿著就能放心了……　不過話說回來，也不會想失去性命吧……」","sc":"“哦……那总之拿着就能放心了……　不过话说回来，也不会想失去性命吧……”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","level":31,"dmin":18,"dmax":26,"quantity":1,"chars":["firis","ilmeria","kald","oskar","sophie"],"recipe_points":1700,"catalysts":[{"id":"hidden-power","name":{"en":"(Hidden Power)","ja":"（神秘の力）","tc":"（神祕之力）","sc":"（神秘之力）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-magic-tools"},{"id":"wood","name":{"en":"(Wood)","ja":"（木材）","tc":"（木材）","sc":"（木材）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-lumber"}],"categories":[{"id":"weapon","name":{"en":"(Weapon)","ja":"（武器）","tc":"（武器）","sc":"（武器）"},"icon":"firis-category-weapon"}],"monsters":[{"id":"burning-rose","name":{"en":"Burning Rose","ja":"バーニングローズ","tc":"烈焰玫瑰","sc":"烈焰玫瑰"}},{"id":"bleed-wings-of-calamity","name":{"en":"Bleed, Wings of Calamity","ja":"兇翼　ブリード","tc":"凶翼　喋血","sc":"凶翼　喋血"}},{"id":"justrun-foryourlife","name":{"en":"Justrun-Foryourlife","ja":"ゲキヤバイダケ","tc":"激惡菇","sc":"激恶菇"}},{"id":"shell-dragon","name":{"en":"Shell Dragon","ja":"強羅竜","tc":"強羅龍","sc":"强罗龙"}},{"id":"guardian","name":{"en":"Guardian","ja":"ガーディアン","tc":"守護者","sc":"守护者"}},{"id":"dark-guardian","name":{"en":"Dark Guardian","ja":"黒曜の守護者","tc":"黑曜的守護者","sc":"黑曜的守护者"}},{"id":"avenger","name":{"en":"Avenger","ja":"アヴェンジャー","tc":"復仇者","sc":"复仇者"}},{"id":"nameless-ancient-one","name":{"en":"Nameless Ancient One","ja":"名もなき古き竜","tc":"無名古龍","sc":"无名古龙"}},{"id":"admiral-puni","name":{"en":"Admiral Puni","ja":"あどみらプニ","tc":"司令噗尼","sc":"司令噗尼"}},{"id":"funny-face","name":{"en":"Funny Face","ja":"ファニーフェイス","t